<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Average length behavior (tokens) for two base models. Both think and answer lengths are computed as the per-problem mean over <math id="S4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=8</annotation></semantics></math> samples, and then averaged over each dataset.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
