<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">Z. Li, J. Zhong, Z. Zheng, X. Wen, Z. Xu, Y. Cheng, F. Zhang, and Q. Xu</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_year"> (2026)</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title"><span id="bib.bib1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Making slow thinking faster: compressing LLM chain-of-thought via step entropy</span></span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_inbook"><span id="bib.bib1.18" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The Fourteenth International Conference on Learning Representations</span></span>,
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">External Links: <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_links"><a href="https://openreview.net/forum?id=cGLqQfS5wH" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_bib_external"><span class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Link</span></a></span>
